### Week 4 tests (REST Client). Prerequisites: run db/migrations/004_maruf_week4.sql if your DB was created before Week 4.
### Make 2 users by hand-approving them in SQL (see README): one approved PROVIDER, one verified STUDENT.
@host = http://localhost:4000

### Provider login
# @name provider
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "provider@metrouni.edu.bd", "password": "StrongPass123" }

### Provider: Service ON
PATCH {{host}}/api/offers/service
Authorization: Bearer {{provider.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "on": true }

### Provider: publish offer
POST {{host}}/api/offers
Authorization: Bearer {{provider.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "origin_name": "Dhanmondi", "destination_name": "Uttara",
  "route": { "type": "LineString", "coordinates": [[90.3742,23.7461],[90.3900,23.7800],[90.3990,23.8759]] },
  "departure_at": "2026-12-01T08:00:00+06:00", "window_minutes": 15, "fare_bdt": 100
}

### Provider: share current location (must be >= 1 km by road from the student pickup)
POST {{host}}/api/rides/provider-location
Authorization: Bearer {{provider.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "lon": 90.4100, "lat": 23.7300 }

### Student login
# @name student
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "student@metrouni.edu.bd", "password": "StrongPass123" }

### Student search: whole route inside provider route -> should MATCH (needs internet for OSRM)
POST {{host}}/api/rides/search
Authorization: Bearer {{student.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "route": { "type": "LineString", "coordinates": [[90.3742,23.7461],[90.3900,23.7800],[90.3990,23.8759]] },
  "depart_after": "2026-12-01T06:00:00+06:00", "depart_before": "2026-12-01T10:00:00+06:00"
}

### Student search: route leaves provider route -> NO match (AT-07)
POST {{host}}/api/rides/search
Authorization: Bearer {{student.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "route": { "type": "LineString", "coordinates": [[90.3742,23.7461],[90.4200,23.7000]] },
  "depart_after": "2026-12-01T06:00:00+06:00", "depart_before": "2026-12-01T10:00:00+06:00"
}
